                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If this was a 2 dollar mobile app, I would recommend it.  It's somewhere between chess and checkers with spaceships. It feels more like a puzzler than a tactical game, victory requiring just the right sequence of moves. There isn't much room for error, and no save options.  There's no customization, no ship designing, and no editing loadouts; any of which would have added a little spice to an otherwise bland 2D experience. It's not a bad game, just not worth the price.",
